OL,3,GNEWSAMajor art show starts UK tour in
OL,4,ACoventry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision to start the 10th edition
OL,7,Fof the British Art Show (BAS) in
OL,8,FCoventry is an important moment for the
OL,9,FWest Midlands' art scene, according to
OL,10,Fthe head of an art collective in the
OL,11,Fcity.
OL,13,FThe Hayward Gallery Touring's BAS 10
OL,14,Fshow, a Chorus of Strangers, has its
OL,15,Fopening on 2 October, with displays at
OL,16,FWarwick Arts Centre's Mead Gallery,
OL,17,FCoventry University and the Herbert Art
OL,18,FGallery and Museum. It will later move
OL,19,Fon to other cities.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
