OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1790940391
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMajor art show starts UK tour in
OL,4,ACoventry
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is really important because there
OL,7,Fisn't anything in Coventry which
OL,8,Fsupports artists to explore visual
OL,9,Farts," said Kyla Craig, the creative
OL,10,Fdirector of Art Riot Collective.
OL,12,F"I really feel like this show is moving
OL,13,Fthrough the cities and what we want to
OL,14,Fsee from it is how we connect artists
OL,15,Ffrom the area locally that are outside
OL,16,FLondon."
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
